  (text "TIA (U4 LMP7721):  Vout = VREF +/- I_det x Rf\nRf = 2M2  ->  1.14 uA full scale (CEM),  57 pA / LSB\nRf = 100M ->  25 nA full scale (Faraday), 1.25 pA / LSB\nC1 sets the TIA pole: 7.2 kHz on 2M2, 159 Hz on 100M\nR3/C2 = 1k/1uF anti-alias: fc = 159 Hz  (Nyquist at 860 SPS is 430 Hz)\nD1 clamps DET_IN to VREF +/- 0.6 V at zero bias" (at 17.78 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "65810367-f608-41c8-81b9-1119cf500a24"))
